% A3-MAKE1: DEFINE WORDS AND DATA, THEN IMAGE THEM INTO T1 (IMAGE, WHICH IS
% IMAGE_WRT) AND R1 (0 .IMAGE, THE PRE-V4 READ-ONLY FORM).  TYPED AT THE
% CONSOLE: AN IMAGE MADE INSIDE A LOAD FREEZES U_IFI (SEE C1).
'IMGUTIL.STO LOAD
DECIMAL
'SQ : DUP * ;
1234 'V1 VARIABLE
4321 V1 !
20 'S1 SVARIABLE
"HELLO FROM LAYER 1" S1 MOVE_STRING
DATE @ 'REV0 VARIABLE
'S1.TMP SAVE
"T1:" MSG CR
'T1.TMP IMAGE
HEX
IORB<<
HINFO SHOW
>
PTRS
DECIMAL
"PARENT REVISION UNCHANGED" MSG DATE @ REV0 @ EQ = CR
IORB<<
"R1:" MSG CR
'R1.TMP 0 .IMAGE
HINFO SHOW
>
